WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.714 --> 00:00:04.192
- [Man] Everyone had
to learn how to fight.

00:00:04.192 --> 00:00:05.276
Everyone had to get in shape.

00:00:05.276 --> 00:00:07.844
It seems unfair, because
Will, you played Ali.

00:00:07.844 --> 00:00:10.948
It feels like you started, and
you took that so seriously,

00:00:10.948 --> 00:00:11.781
- [Will] Yeah, I did.
- [Man] You really learned to

00:00:11.781 --> 00:00:13.109
- [Man] fight like Ali.
You had a head start.

00:00:13.109 --> 00:00:14.541
- [Will] Yeah, nah, you know.

00:00:14.541 --> 00:00:16.174
I thought I had a head start,

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:18.531
and then I got on the set with this,

00:00:18.531 --> 00:00:22.023
this group of people,
and I'm 47 this year,

00:00:22.023 --> 00:00:25.931
and the average here is probably 12.

00:00:25.931 --> 00:00:28.158
(laughing)

00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:31.716
You know, so, I'm
messing around with Joel,

00:00:31.716 --> 00:00:33.689
and it's like everybody's looking,

00:00:33.689 --> 00:00:35.387
Adewale's looking all strong,

00:00:35.387 --> 00:00:38.207
and I was like, you know,
I gotta take my position.

00:00:38.207 --> 00:00:39.040
- [Man] Right.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.531
- [Will] Two weeks in, I tore my calf.

00:00:40.531 --> 00:00:41.364
- [Man] Oh really?

00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:43.682
- [Will] I was like ah,
(mimics yelping dog), ah!

00:00:43.682 --> 00:00:45.080
(audience laughs)

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.582
You know the sound you make with,

00:00:46.582 --> 00:00:48.343
the sound a dog makes
when you step on his foot?

00:00:48.343 --> 00:00:49.176
- [Man] Yeah.

00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:50.535
- [Will] Yeah, I made
that (mimics dog barking).

00:00:50.535 --> 00:00:52.188
(laughter)

00:00:52.188 --> 00:00:53.956
- [Man] And Adewale, is that right?

00:00:53.956 --> 00:00:55.173
You were sparring with,

00:00:55.173 --> 00:00:56.523
a lot of these guys were
sparring with each other.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.443
You were sparring with the ladies, right?

00:00:58.443 --> 00:00:59.826
- [Adewale] Don't ask me why, Conan,

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.128
but they put me with the ladies.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:05.569
And I fought Karen Fukuhara,

00:01:05.569 --> 00:01:07.400
but believe me, Kick-ahara,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.668
(laughing)

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.468
and I fought Cara Delevingne

00:01:10.468 --> 00:01:13.357
who can
(crowd cheers)

00:01:13.357 --> 00:01:15.175
- [Woman] That's right, that's right.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.609
- [Adewale] And let me tell you,

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.163
Cara will Delevingne you, man.

00:01:18.163 --> 00:01:19.733
(laughter)

